    "long_instructions": "## **Remove First Task**\r\n\r\nWhen the user clicks **First**, the **first task** in the list should be removed.\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Use AI to help you write a function called `removeFirstTask`.\r\n\r\n2. In the function, use `.shift()` to:\r\n    - remove the first item from `titleArray`\r\n    - remove the first item from `detailArray`\r\n    - remove the first item from `isPriorityArray`\r\n\r\n3. Call `renderTasks()` as the last line of the `removeFirstTask` function.\r\n\r\n4. Use your function as the event handler for the **Remove First** button."
  },
